🎉 Announcing the immediate availability of PHP 8.6.0

See what's new in this release already:

* Partial Function Application
* New \Time\Duration class
* Polling API
* New clamp() Function
* New SortDirection Enum
* Readonly Property Defaults

👓 Read more about it: https://www.php.net/releases/8.6/

